A-NET SIMS v1.0 - BBS Sysop Sim
-------------------------------
Run your own BBS from a 300-baud
XT to a 16-node T1 powerhouse.  16
classic doors (LORD, TW2002, LORD2,
BRE, TEOS, RDQ3, OO2, Elderwood...)
9 CD-ROMs, 15 BBS packages (Synchro-
net, Mystic, WWIV, Renegade...), 10
protection kits (firewall, VPN,
IDS...) and a Dark Market for hack
kits + viruses.  Hack 8 corporate
targets OR other sysops on your own
BBS - their save files are real.
Turn cap, winnable, scores.ans +
dot-matrix printer log export.
Sysop config: anetsims --config
Door32.sys Win32 + Linux.
